dark on TV for a stretch, per WSOC and the Daily Wire. The race is about costs, tariffs and health care on Cooper's side and crime, taxes and Cooper's record as governor on Whatley's, per ABC11 and Spectrum News.","issues":[{"issue":"Cost of living and tariffs","why":"Cooper says Congress should reclaim power over tariffs that hurt consumers, while Whatley promises lower taxes and higher take home pay.","src":"https://abc11.com/post/cooper-whatley-meet-voters-discuss-affordability-public-safety/19679596/"},{"issue":"Crime and public safety","why":"Whatley attacks a 2021 COVID era settlement that led to early prison releases, and Cooper cites his record prosecuting criminals as attorney general.","src":"https://www.wspa.com/news/politics/elections/whatley-cooper-clash-in-dueling-campaign-stops-on-crime-cost-of-living-in-central-nc/amp/"},{"issue":"Health care costs","why":"Cooper says the One Big Beautiful Bill Act Whatley backed cut ACA subsidies, while Whatley blames Cooper for rising premiums and rural closures.","src":"https://spectrumlocalnews.com/nc/charlotte/news/2026/09/11/nc-senate-race-cooper-whatley-"},{"issue":"Hurricane Helene recovery","why":"Whatley served as Trump's recovery czar for western North Carolina, and Cooper's campaign calls his tenure a failure while Whatley's side cites billions in federal aid.","src":"https://www.theassemblync.com/news/politics/elections/michael-whatley-helene-czar-senate-2026/"},{"issue":"Energy and utility rates","why":"Cooper opposes Duke Energy rate hikes and says Whatley lobbied for utilities, while Whatley backs gas and nuclear and faults Cooper for the Atlantic Coast Pipeline.","src":"https://abc11.com/post/cooper-whatley-meet-voters-discuss-affordability-public-safety/19679596/"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Whatley campaign goes dark on TV","date":"2026-10-15","what":"Whatley's last broadcast ad aired Oct. 7 and his campaign had no future TV reservations, though it called the pause temporary, while Cooper's side held